      <div><h2 class="cta-h">Want a partner who preps, attends, and follows up on your meetings?</h2><p class="cta-p">A real person will walk through how your community&rsquo;s meetings and minutes are handled &mdash; within two business days.</p></div>
      <div><a class="btn btn-blue" href="/request-a-proposal">Request a proposal <span class="arrow">&rarr;</span></a></div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

